k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG1vKTr,"","Lake People","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers","The PHONE AMP G111 is the successor of famous Lake People G109 and the G100 which can be regarded as the ancestor of the HiFi / HiEnd units from Lake People and Violectric. Phone-Amp G100 was the first item from Lake People which was widely used by professional and private customers. Professionals praised the indestructible construction while private users loved the exceptional sound quality. Also, PHONE-AMP G100 / G109 / G111 defined for the first time or technical guidelines which are still unique in their combination:",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG1vKge,"","AudioQuest","hi-fi-audio/dacs","Many tens of thousands of music lovers are already enjoying better audio enabled by the original AudioQuest JitterBug USB Noise Filter—plugged into cars’ USB jacks, laptop computers, USB “service-only” jacks on Ethernet Streamers, and more. ",""
