k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG1vPuL,"","Enleum","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers","In 2021, Enleum (previously manufacturing under Bakoon International) took a big leap forward. Actively establishing their own brand identity with technology advancements and unique award-winning designs. Introducing the Enleum AMP-23R, the follow-up model on the Bakoon International Amp-23r.",""
