k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG2itJe,"","Sony","headphones/wireless | headphones/gaming | headphones/in-ear","Welcome to Sang-Logium, your premier destination for cutting-edge audio technology. Today, we’re excited to introduce the Sony LinkBuds Truly Wireless Earbuds, designed to seamlessly connect your digital and physical worlds. These earbuds are a perfect blend of innovation and comfort, offering exceptional sound quality and unique features that cater to your modern lifestyle. Dive into the details below and see why the Sony LinkBuds are the perfect addition to your audio arsenal. The Sony LinkBuds feature a groundbreaking open ring driver design that allows you to stay aware of your surroundings while enjoying your favorite music or taking calls. This innovative design links your digital content with the real world, ensuring you never miss a moment of what’s happening around you. Whether you’re commuting, working out, or just relaxing at home, the LinkBuds keep you connected and engaged.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG2itnA,"","KEF","hi-fi-audio/speakers/subwoofers","Don't let its compact size fool you, the Kube 8b may not take up much space but the bass it delivers is anything but small. With an 8 inch driver the Kube8b is perfect for smaller living rooms. It shares the 300 Watts Class D amp as the larger Kubes, as well as iBX technology to extend the bass depth dynamically.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG2iuRV,"","KEF","speakers/subwoofers | speakers/powered","The KEF Kube 15 MIE stands as the pinnacle of the Kube range, designed specifically to fill large rooms with deep, earth-shaking bass. Equipped with a formidable 15-inch driver and powered by a 300W (RMS) Class D amplifier, this subwoofer is your gateway to experiencing the most immersive bass performance possible. Enhanced by the Music Integrity Engine®, the Kube 15 MIE ensures that you feel every beat with unparalleled depth and dynamics. With its sleek, sealed cabinet design, the Kube 15 MIE not only promises optimal placement flexibility but also adds a touch of modern elegance to your space. Its contemporary aesthetic effortlessly integrates into your home decor, making it a statement piece that complements any interior design theme.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG2ivGf,"","Sennheiser","headphones/wireless | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","Step up to great wireless sound with the new HD 450BT. Whether relaxing at home or on the go, you enjoy an exceptional combination of versatility and superior sound.",""
