k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG2j9JO,"","Klipsch","speakers/bluetooth | speakers/outdoor","The Klipsch Austin Portable Bluetooth Speaker brings the power of live music to your personal space, no matter where you are. Equipped with a 1.5” full-range driver, this compact speaker delivers a robust sound performance. Coupled with dual passive radiators, the Klipsch Austin ensures your music is accompanied by deep, resonant bass, making it the perfect companion for any genre. With up to 12 hours of battery life on a single charge, the Klipsch Austin is designed for long-lasting musical enjoyment. Whether you're exploring the vibrant streets of your city or embarking on an outdoor adventure, this speaker ensures your soundtrack continues uninterrupted, providing the perfect backdrop for your day.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG2jAqp,"","Bowers & Wilkins","headphones/noise-cancelling | headphones/gaming | headphones/travel | headphones/in-ear","In-ear True Wireless earbuds.50 years of audio experience go into making the extraordinary PI5 wireless earbuds. Banish distractions with advanced noise-cancelling, enjoy impeccable call quality and hear music the way the artist intended, with incredible aptX sound quality. With aptX for high-quality wireless transmission, you can enjoy an incredibly immersive audio experience, whether you’re listening to your favorite music or the latest blockbuster movie.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG2jBER,"","Matrix Audio","hi-fi-audio/media-players-and-streamers","This is the 4th generation product under the mini-i series name from Matrix Audio continuing the classic design and superb build quality. The new Mini-i Pro 3 uses a two-color aluminum shell in silent black and space gray with a 3.3-inch LCD screen and a brand new user interface. The Mini-i Pro 3 provides improved user experience and stunning good looks. ",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG2jBlt,"","Chord Electronics","hi-fi-audio/media-players-and-streamers","All Chord Electronics Poly V3 Open Box are tested, inspected and cleaned by our meticulous returns team and sold in like condition with their original packaging and accessories. The Chord Electronics Poly is a portable music streamer/player that combines with Mojo to wirelessly stream from connected devices and playback from its Micro SD, all with smartphone control. It enables hi-fi sound quality at home or on-the-go.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG2jDTA,"","Noble Audio","headphones/wireless | headphones/gaming | headphones/travel | headphones/in-ear","The Noble Audio FoKus Rex5 pushes the boundaries of wireless audio with its revolutionary hybrid driver setup, personalized sound technology, and feature-packed design. This latest addition to Noble Audio’s FoKus lineup combines innovation with a sleek design, delivering an unparalleled listening experience tailored to every individual. Whether you’re an audiophile or someone seeking exceptional true wireless performance, the Rex5 is a game-changer in personal audio. From its cutting-edge hybrid five-driver configuration to the advanced integration of Audiodo sound personalization, the FoKus Rex5 offers superior sound quality, intuitive functionality, and ergonomic comfort in a compact package. Let your music come alive like never before.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG37X8m,"","AudioQuest","accessories/power-strips","When buying high-quality gear, you always want to make sure that gear is protected to the best of your abilities. Now some of you may be risk takers and enjoy plugging your $1000+ set-up into a 10$ Amazon power bar and if that's thrilling for you, so be it. But for others that want to protect their precious gear from an equipment destroying power surge and add some extra performance to their system without shelling out a ton of cash, the brand new AudioQuest PowerQuest 3 is the perfect power line conditioner and surge protector. AudioQuest has their Niagara series which is a great series but its definitely not the most affordable. But with their brand new PowerQuest 2 and PowerQuest 3, AudioQuest is providing excellent protection and performance for a fraction of the cost.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG37Xq4,"","Kanto Living","accessories/speaker-stands","Experience the full range of frequencies your speakers have to offer with the pair of S2 Desktop Speaker Stands from Kanto Audio. These sturdy, aluminum stands allow for 16° of vertical tilt and feature foam padding that provides grip and helps reduce vibration, so you can turn your speakers up loud without worrying about diminished sound quality. Each S2 stand provides 16° of tilt to enhance your listening experience",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG37Y6n,"","Meze","/accessories/audio-cables"," Silver upgrade cable for Meze Empyrean or any compatible 4 pin mini-XLR headphone (Including Audeze's LCD series and ZMF Headphones). Braided Furukawa SILVER PLATED PCUHD Copper 4 pin mini-XLR headphone termination 0.04 mm*140 conductors in 8 wire to 4 wire continuous braid PCUHD (Pure Copper Ultra High Drawability) silver plated single crystallized Each strand is silver plated USA made TPE Sleeve Jensen 4% silver Soldering Compatible Headphones: Meze Audio Empyrean Meze Audio ELITE Audeze LCD-2 Classic Audeze LCD-2 Classic Closed-Back Audeze LCD-2 Audeze LCD-GX Audeze LCD-X Audeze LCD-XC Audeze LCD-3 Audeze LCD-4z ZMF Headphones ",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG37Zsz,"","AudioQuest","accessories/power-strips","The AudioQuest PowerQuest G8 isn't just a surge protector; it's a performance enhancer for your audio and video systems. With its innovative Micro-Spike Technology, the G8 goes beyond traditional surge protectors by safeguarding your equipment from daily short, fast power spikes. These spikes, often overlooked, can gradually damage your equipment over time. The G8 ensures that these harmful micro-spikes are neutralized, preserving the longevity and performance of your precious devices. Lightning strikes and large-scale power surges can spell disaster for your electronic equipment. The PowerQuest G8 offers robust protection against these catastrophic events with its impressive 2160 Joule rating, maximum spike protection of 6kV, and 144kA. This level of protection gives you peace of mind, knowing that your valuable audio and video components are shielded from the most severe electrical threats.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG37bAg,"","Dekoni Audio","accessories/tips-and-ear-pads","The Audeze LCD Collection is one of the finest series of planar magnetic headphones ever created. Dekoni Audio created this model due to the limited availability of quality pads to maintain the incredible experience these headphones already give.",""
k27n1AQuIbSr5iozG37bo2,"","Kanto Living","accessories/speaker-stands","Improve your desktop listening experience with this pair of Kanto S6 Tilted Desktop Speaker Stands. Designed for 4 to 7"" speakers, such as the Kanto Living YU6 and TUK, these stands tilt the front of your speakers upward by 16°. The angle of tilt is engineered to better deliver audio to your ears, allowing you to experience a fuller range of frequencies. Foam padding on the top and bottom of the stand work to reduce vibration as you turn up the volume. For compatible speakers, you can ensure that they stay in place on the stand with the included screws and integrated 1/4""-20 mounting holes.",""
