moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtUHWs,"","Focal","headphones/over-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","Our Take: The Focal Clear will bring you 5% short of Utopia. Meaning the Focal Clear is about 95% of its bigger brother, the Focal Utopia. The Clear has some of the best detail, resolution and dynamics in its price range however if you are looking for a little more low-end we recommend looking elsewhere as the Clear does have a brighter sound signature. Sang-Logium has partnered with Focal to secure exclusive rights to Focal's last manufacturing run of the Focal Clear. The Focal Clear is now discontinued and only available for $890 (SAVE $600!) from Sang-Logium! As it is the last manufacturing run and a Final Sale item, the Focal Clear is final sale and cannot be returned. However, the Clear is fully covered under Focal's manufacturer warranty.","Headphone Design: Over-Ear, Open Back; Impedance: 55 ohms; Sensitivity: 104dB SPL / 1mW @ 1kHz; Total Harmonic Distortion (THD): 0,25% @ 1kHz / 100dB SPL; Frequency Response: 5Hz - 28kHz; Driver Materials & Size: 1.6"" (40mm) Aluminum/Magnesium 'M'-shape dome; Headphone Weight: 450 grams; Warranty: 3 years manufacturer's warranty"
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtWl8T,"","Audeze","headphones/over-ear | headphones/studio | headphones/studio-and-recording | headphones/gaming","Unrivaled Audio Powered by Audeze’s latest 90mm planar magnetic drivers, with over 3X the driver area of leading competitors, Maxwell delivers powerful bass and pinpoint precision. Audeze drivers are trusted by leading recording and game studios worldwide, and feature patented technologies including Uniforce voice coils, Fluxor magnets, and Fazor waveguides. Experience class-leading high-resolution audio up to 24-bit/96kHz over Wireless or USB.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtX5bB,"","Focal","headphones/over-ear | headphones/gaming | headphones/travel","Open-box Focal Bathys have been tested and inspected by our team. All open-box Focal Bathys are sold in like-new condition. Focal has taken the design, technology, and materials of industry-leading headphones like the Stellia and Celestee, cut some weight, and added a lot of advanced technology. This is a first for Focal, and a huge step forward for the industry.You’ll experience a balanced and neutral sound that’s faithful to the source, but influenced by Focal’s award-winning approach to dynamics, punchiness, and lively reproduction. Either way, these are probably the headphones you’ll end up using the most. The result is a comfortable, easy-to-use set of headphones that wrings every last bit of quality out of the latest Bluetooth wireless codecs but also gives you the option of an excellent wired experience via USB-C and its built-in DAC. And it will last you all week: 30+ hours of listening on a full charge. Running low? Rapid-charging gives you five extra listening hours in just 15 minutes.","THD: <0.2 % @ 1kHz / 100dB SPL; Frequency response: 5Hz – 50kHz; Speaker driver: 1 5/8"" (40mm) Aluminum-Magnesium ‘M’-shaped dome; Weight: 0.77lb (350g)"
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtXu6V,"","Hifiman","headphones/over-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","Our Take: ﻿A direct competitor to the Sennheiser HD800S, Focal Clear and Audeze LCD-X, the Hifiman Arya are perfect for anyone that craves an expansive soundstage (not on the level of the HD800S) and a brighter sound signature. Lightweight and comfortable, the Arya are easy to leave on your head all day while you're at the office or at home listening to music. With a recent price drop from $1599 to $1299, the Hifiman Arya Planar Magnetic Headphones will not disappoint. Arya is the culmination of HifiMan’s work. Never has a company brought this kind of Planar performance at this price point. Fast, wide soundstage and mind-blowing detail make the Arya a must-listen. HifiMan Arya features a driver based on the HE1000 V2 headphones, one of the best drivers on the market in our opinion, which raises the sonic characteristics to a considerably higher level than similarly priced products.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtXuiC,"","Focal","headphones/over-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","Focal Radiance Review - Written review by Chrono ",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtXvWl,"","Focal","headphones/over-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","Audio component with solid performance.","Sensitivity: 104dB SPL / 1 mW @ 1kHz; Total Harmonic Distortion (THD): 0.25% @ 1kHz / 100dB SPL; Frequency Response: 5Hz – 28kHz; Driver Type: Dynamic; Driver Materials & Size: 40mm ‘M’-shaped magnesium dome; Headphone Weight: 450 grams; Warranty: 3 years manufacturer's warranty"
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtbizC,"","Audeze","headphones/over-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/studio | headphones/studio-and-recording | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","Our Take: The Audeze LCD-X Creator's Edition (and Premium Package) are one of Audeze's most popular headphones, with good reason. Made with studio engineers in mind, the LCD-X targets a neutral sound with a touch of warmth resulting in a more laid-back listen than what you would get from something like the Focal Clear or Hifiman Arya. However, the LCD-X does weigh 612 grams so comfort can be an issue for some. The Audeze LCD-X Creator's Edition contains 1 x Single-ended 1/4"" cable as well as Audeze's Economy Travel carrying case.","Style: Over-ear, open-back; Driver Type: Planar Magnetic; Magnetic structure: Proprietary magnet array; Phase management: Fazor™; Magnet type: Neodymium N50; Diaphragm type: Ultra-Thin Uniforce™; Driver Size: 106 mm; Maximum SPL: >130dB; Frequency response: 10Hz - 50kHz; Total Harmonic Distortion (THD): <0.1% @ 100 dB SPL"
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtbjv7,"","FiiO","headphones/on-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","The top Closed-Back Headphones of 2024 are here! The FiiO FT1 Closed-Back Headphones redefine the listening experience by combining innovative acoustic engineering with luxurious design. Crafted with natural wood ear shells in your choice of walnut or beech, the FT1 not only delivers outstanding audio quality but also stands as a piece of functional art. The natural wood material reduces cavity resonance, minimizes standing waves, and creates a warm, immersive tonal balance perfect for music lovers and audio professionals alike.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtbklW,"","Sennheiser","headphones/on-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","Check out Ian Dunmore's (@Torq) review of the Sennheiser HD 820 as part of The HEADPHONE Community Preview Program in the link below. Ian Dunmore's (@Torq) Sennheiser HD 820 Review","Sensitivity: 103 dB; Frequency Response: 12 - 43800 Hz (-3 dB); Driver Type: Dynamic; Headphone Weight: 360 grams; Warranty: 2 years manufacturer's warranty"
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtbkq7,"","Dan Clark Audio","headphones/on-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/travel | headphones/over-ear","All Open-Box items are tested and inspected by our team and sold in like-new condition. Embark on an auditory journey with the Dan Clark Audio E3, a marvel in the world of closed-back headphones. Building upon the iconic Ether C Flow, the E3 is a complete redesign that integrates state-of-the-art technology with an eye-catching black and blue design. The E3 stands out as a masterpiece of innovation, blending ergonomic form with Gorilla Glass 3 clad cups, symbolizing a new era in headphone craftsmanship.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtblBG,"","Meze","headphones/on-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/travel | headphones/over-ear","The Meze Audio LIRIC II represents a harmonious blend of industrial design prowess and cutting-edge technological innovation. Designed for the active audiophile who demands both mobility and exceptional sound quality, the LIRIC II offers a refined sound profile that strikes a perfect balance between warmth and clarity. Utilizing the innovative Quarter Wavelength Resonator Mask (QWRM), this headphone effectively attenuates high-frequency peaks above 7kHz, ensuring a listening experience that is both rich and non-fatiguing. Rooted in the tradition of Maramures craftsmanship, the LIRIC II maintains the iconic design language of its predecessor while introducing a touch of warmth through the use of wood in the ear cups. The chosen material, Macassar ebony, is a dense and aesthetically pleasing hardwood known for its deep brown coloration and intricate golden-brown stripes. Each pair of headphones is unique, with the distinctiveness of Macassar ebony ensuring that every LIRIC II is not just a device for music but a personal statement piece with its own story.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtblsT,"","Sony","headphones/on-ear | headphones/gaming | headphones/travel | headphones/over-ear","The Sony WH-1000XM5 headphones set a new standard in noise cancellation technology. With two powerful processors managing eight sophisticated microphones, these headphones offer unparalleled noise cancellation. They adeptly filter out a broad range of high and mid-frequency sounds, including airplane noise and human voices, thanks to Sony's innovative Auto NC Optimizer. This feature continuously adapts to your surroundings and wearing conditions, ensuring the most effective noise cancellation in any environment. Sony's biggest leap in noise canceling technology is embodied in the WH-1000XM5. The eight-microphone system captures ambient sound with exceptional accuracy, significantly reducing high-frequency noise. The Auto NC Optimizer further refines this capability, dynamically adjusting to external factors, such as atmospheric pressure, to provide an optimized listening experience.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtbmis,"","Denon","headphones/on-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","Reliable audio accessory built to last.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtbnF3,"","Denon","headphones/on-ear | headphones/wired | headphones/gaming | headphones/over-ear","The Denon AH-D7200 represents the pinnacle of headphone engineering, featuring Japanese-crafted FreeEdge 50mm drivers housed in elegant American walnut enclosures and paired with premium cabling. These elements work in harmony to deliver pristine audio reproduction through precise driver movement, resulting in exceptional accuracy and minimal distortion. With Hi-Res Audio certification, these headphones are engineered for listeners who demand the absolute best. Drawing on over five decades of audio expertise and meticulous craftsmanship, the Denon AH-D7200 stands as a testament to acoustic excellence. These premium headphones deliver crystalline clarity and true-to-source fidelity that will satisfy the most demanding audiophile's quest for sonic perfection.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtdOCp,"","KEF","hi-fi-audio/speakers/bookshelf-speakers","Great loudspeakers disappear, leaving just the music. LS50 Meta is such a loudspeaker. The incredibly immersive sound means you lose yourself in your favourite music. Savouring every nuance as layer upon layer of instrumentation is delivered with exceptional acoustic accuracy anywhere in the room. A truly revolutionary tool in the KEF acoustic armoury, Metamaterial Absorption Technology ( MAT™) is a highly complex maze-like structure that absorbs 99% of the unwanted sound from the rear of the driver, eliminating the resulting distortion and providing purer, more natural sound.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtdOZo,"","KEF","hi-fi-audio/speakers/bookshelf-speakers","Quality audio product for music enthusiasts.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtdOi5,"","Kanto Living","speakers/bluetooth","Effortlessly fill your room with rich, spacious sound. Featuring carefully designed 4-inch Kevlar® drivers and 1-inch silk dome tweeters, YU4 faithfully reproduces your favorite tunes, letting you enjoy them to their fullest. Throw on your latest vinyl with a built-in phono preamp, or sit back and stream your carefully curated playlist via Bluetooth™ 4.0 with Qualcomm aptX. Crystal-clear, detailed sound for all to enjoy.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWtdPMX,"","Kanto Living","speakers/bookshelf | speakers/powered","Our Take: The Kanto TUK Powered Bookshelf Speakers are Kanto's flagship speakers and with good reason. Using Class-D technology, the Kanto TuK delivers a rich, full sound with strong low-end impact and wonderful treble response through it's AMT tweeter. In addition, the Kanto TUK features a plethora of connectivity making it a versatile beast in your home audio set-up. You can even pair them directly with a turntable! The AMT (Air Motion Transformer) tweeters are designed to deliver bright, accurate highs for an enhanced soundstage, regardless of your position in the room. Further, the high rigidity and low mass of the aluminum drivers allow them to operate efficiently while reducing distortion for clarity at nearly any volume.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwESUS,"","Hifiman","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers","In 2012, Dr. Fang Bian and his team at HIFIMAN introduced the EF6, the legendary desktop DAC/amplifier that delivered gobs of power for a wide, detailed soundstage. Then years later, HIFIMAN is proud to introduce a new model, EF400 that incorporates the best of recently developed technologies, especially the company's advanced HIMALAYA R2R DAC. The EF400 is the modern desktop DAC/Amp solution, with a compact footprint and a price to match, but with sonics that outperform products many times its size",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwESiF,"","Burson Audio","hi-fi-audio/dacs"," Burson Audio is challenging the conventional and pushing the boundaries of audio excellence through innovation. A decade ago, we argued against using IC opamps on the audio signal path. Today, our discrete audio opamps are industry benchmarks.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwET3O,"","iFi Audio","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers","Well-built audio equipment for home setups.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwETNc,"","EarMen","hi-fi-audio/dacs","Introducing the EarMen Tradutto, a state-of-the-art, fully balanced DAC designed to redefine your audio experience. With its sophisticated design and wide range of capabilities, the Tradutto is not just a DAC; it's an upgrade to your entire audio system, promising to enhance the sonic performance of your favorite music and media. At the heart of Tradutto lies the ES9038Q2M DAC, a marvel of audio engineering that effortlessly handles digital audio files up to 32bit/768kHz or DSD512. This high-performance DAC, combined with an optimized circuit that minimizes power consumption and interference, ensures that your audio experience is nothing short of extraordinary.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwETaU,"","headphones.com","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers"," First came the Leeloo, then the Pendant. Now the Leeloo returns better than ever! Forged in collaboration with Justin and his team at Ampsandsound the Sang-Logium team is thrilled to present the new and improved Leeloo. Not only will it sound magical for your headphone needs but you can also pair it with your favourite pair of efficient speakers to produce a truly euphoric experience.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwETjg,"","Chord Electronics","hi-fi-audio/dacs","The new Chord Electronics Anni desktop integrated amplifier brings ULTIMA technology to a desktop format for the first time and is capable of powering both high-performance headphones and desktop loudspeakers. The compact amplifier forms part of the Chord Electronics Qutest range and seamlessly complements the resolving abilities of the multi-award-winning Qutest standalone DAC and Huei phono stage. As a system, the Qutest components provide an unrivalled desktop audio solution that is perfectly supported by the compact QSS (Qutest Stand System). In consistency with the rest of the Qutest range, Anni will only be available in black. Anni offers the recently announced dual-feed-forward error-correction circuit topology whether using headphones or compact loudspeakers. Anni’s advanced technology allows it to drive any headphone load, error-monitored and compensated amplification at all times.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEUpi,"","Weiss","hi-fi-audio/dacs","Weiss Engineering’s DAC204 stands out as the ultimate digital-to-analog converter, versatile enough to cater to a wide range of audio needs. Dubbed the ""Swiss Army Knife"" of DACs, it offers easy switching between various digital sources, whether from a computer or mobile device, making it a perfect fit for both professional and audiophile environments. The DAC204 excels in providing pristine, low-jitter conversion to analog audio. It employs an advanced setup of four oversampling sigma-delta D/A converters per channel, operated in parallel. This configuration enhances the signal-to-noise performance, ensuring top-notch audio output for both professional mixing/mastering studios and audiophile-grade listening rooms.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEZTT,"","Violectric","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers","Audio component with solid performance.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEaXf,"","SMSL","hi-fi-audio/dacs"," The SU-6 Desktop Mini HiFi Audio DAC’s small footprint makes it perfect for desktop use, and includes a remote control and Bluetooth support for when you’re AFK.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEcU6,"","Benchmark Media Systems","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers","From the first watt to the last watt, no audio power amplifier offers lower noise or lower distortion than the Benchmark AHB2.Benchmark has raised the bar by introducing a new and revolutionary amplifier! -Bascom King, BHK Labs",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEdEz,"","Topping","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers","Along with the latest E50 MQA desktop DAC, Topping has unveiled its latest balanced headphone amplifier, Behold the latest Topping L50. Using a redesigned NFCA circuit, the L50 brings extraordinary clean sound signal amplification with ultra-low distortion and high SNR ratings. The amplifier has a maximum output power rating of up to 3500mW or 3.5W at 16Ω of load. Even at 600Ω, the L50 provides up to 290mW of power that is more than enough to power up demanding cans without any trouble. For sensitive IEMs, don't worry, the Topping L50 has an ultra-low output impedance of <0.1Ω and a super clean noise-floor, pair them without worrying about any background noise. The latest Topping L50 is designed to match with the latest E50 MQA DAC, making an amazing Desktop stack with MQA decoding and powerful output. Redesigned new NFCA circuit based on the same working principle as the one in A30 Pro. It provides 2x power at 300 Ohm compared to L30.The new circuit shares the same 0.3uV ultra-low noise and 145dB dynamic range as well as 0.00006% THD+N.With the help of NFCA, L50 easily reaches the top of the industry, and it has almost perfect performance regardless of distortion, dynamic range, and multi-tone testing.L50 has three gain options. Covering a wide gain range is sufficient to meet the needs of low-sensitivity full-sized over-ears to high-sensitivity 1EMs. With the help of extremely low noise 0.3uV, even lEMs will not hear any background noise.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEdNG,"","Burson Audio","hi-fi-audio/dacs","The Conductor 3X GT takes that unique Burson house sound further with a new output stage for its dual ESS9038 DACs. A new feedback based gain control allows this GT to max out at 10 Watts yet matches with even more headphones. With so many functionalities and refinement, you will never want to add another machine to your desktop. Using what we have learned from the Soloist GT and more, we are making the Conductor GT epic!",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEdoq,"","SPL","hi-fi-audio/dacs","With innovative Phonitor Matrix, 32-bit DA-converter and outstanding sound quality. For us the sound is always in the foreground. When it sounds good, we like to listen. To get such a sound, you need experience and technical finesse. We have incorporated both into the Series One.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEeK6,"","Feliks Audio","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers","Class A Single-ended transformer coupled, balanced amplifier, powered by the legendary 300B tubes ",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEenW,"","SPL","hi-fi-audio/amplifiers","Well-built audio equipment for home setups.",""
moXlkADK7m1DHgGwWwEfPD,"","Chord Electronics","hi-fi-audio/dacs","Developed from the multi-award-winning transportable Chord Electronics Hugo 2, the Chord Electronics Hugo TT 2 is bigger, better and more advanced in every way. TT 2 sets a new benchmark for table top DACs, eclipsed only by our flagship DAVE. Hugo TT 2 has been radically redesigned from the ground up, not only with beautiful new casework by Chief Designer, John Franks, but with 5x the processing power of the original Hugo TT and double that of the multi-award-winning Hugo 2. Hugo TT 2 distils over 20 years of digital development by Rob Watts and takes advantage of the very latest technology.",""
