<file path="app/components/features/homepage/product-spotlight-1/copy.json">
{
    "text":  "# Meze — Industrial Grace\n## The Modern Standard\n\nThe LIRIC II is a masterclass in acoustic warmth and structural elegance. By marrying hand-finished Macassar ebony with the innovative Quarter Wavelength Resonator Mask, Meze delivers a closed-back icon that balances rich, organic textures with fatigue-free clarity.\n\nDesigned for the mobile audiophile who refuses to compromise on heritage or performance, the LIRIC II is more than a transducer; it is a personal statement piece crafted to resonate with the soul of the listener.\n"
}
</file>

<file path="app/components/features/homepage/product-spotlight-1/copy.md">
# Meze — Industrial Grace
## The Modern Standard

The LIRIC II is a masterclass in acoustic warmth and structural elegance. By marrying hand-finished Macassar ebony with the innovative Quarter Wavelength Resonator Mask, Meze delivers a closed-back icon that balances rich, organic textures with fatigue-free clarity.

Designed for the mobile audiophile who refuses to compromise on heritage or performance, the LIRIC II is more than a transducer; it is a personal statement piece crafted to resonate with the soul of the listener.
</file>

<file path="app/components/features/homepage/product-spotlight-2/copy.json">
{
    "text":  "# Dan Clark — Engineering Purity\n## The Reference Icon\n\nThe Stealth represents the definitive pursuit of the \"blackest\" background in high-end audio. Utilizing a proprietary Acoustic Metamaterial Tuning System (AMTS), it eliminates standing waves to reveal a soundstage depth and transparency previously thought impossible for a closed-back design.\n\nWhere complexity meets invisibility. With its self-adjusting suspension and ultra-lightweight carbon fiber chassis, the Stealth disappears during use, leaving only the raw, unfiltered emotion of the master recording.\r\n"
}
</file>

<file path="app/components/features/homepage/product-spotlight-2/copy.md">
# Dan Clark — Engineering Purity
## The Reference Icon

The Stealth represents the definitive pursuit of the "blackest" background in high-end audio. Utilizing a proprietary Acoustic Metamaterial Tuning System (AMTS), it eliminates standing waves to reveal a soundstage depth and transparency previously thought impossible for a closed-back design.

Where complexity meets invisibility. With its self-adjusting suspension and ultra-lightweight carbon fiber chassis, the Stealth disappears during use, leaving only the raw, unfiltered emotion of the master recording.
</file>

<file path="app/components/features/homepage/product-spotlight-3/copy.json">
{
    "text":  "# Focal — Acoustic Zenith\n## The Absolute Pinnacle\n\nThe Utopia stands at the unrivaled peak of high-fidelity engineering. Featuring pure Beryllium \"M\"-shaped dome drivers in a specialized open-back architecture, it offers a listening experience of staggering dynamic range and crystalline purity.\n\nAesthetic perfection handcrafted in France. Sculpted with recycled forged carbon yokes and precision honeycomb grilles, the Utopia is the ultimate lightweight masterpiece for those who demand the world’s finest sonic signature.\n"
}
</file>

<file path="app/components/features/homepage/product-spotlight-3/copy.md">
# Focal — Acoustic Zenith
## The Absolute Pinnacle

The Utopia stands at the unrivaled peak of high-fidelity engineering. Featuring pure Beryllium "M"-shaped dome drivers in a specialized open-back architecture, it offers a listening experience of staggering dynamic range and crystalline purity.

Aesthetic perfection handcrafted in France. Sculpted with recycled forged carbon yokes and precision honeycomb grilles, the Utopia is the ultimate lightweight masterpiece for those who demand the world’s finest sonic signature.
</file>

