        "title": "Connectivity",
        "value": "There's a lot to say about MyConnect 250's connectivity... From HDMI to Phono (MM/MC), analog RCA to AES-EBU, USB for computer to multiple optical and coaxial inputs, 3 speaker zones, network (Wi-Fi / Ethernet), and Bluetooth (optional with X-FTB01 / X-FTB02).  Of course, it cannot be a MyConnect product if it does not include a CD player and a FM/DAB tuner.",
        "information": "Product Feature"
      },
      {
        "_type": "overviewField",
        "_key": "ffbe48d0-31b7-47b1-9940-4de3183d5902",
        "title": "Outputs",
        "value": "Even the outputs are well handled, with balanced (XLR) and unbalanced (RCA) Pre-OUT connectors. And don't hesitate to connect 2 subwoofers if you wish, thanks to its two subwoofer outputs.",
        "information": "Product Feature"
      },
      {
        "_type": "overviewField",
        "_key": "52070e37-b3fb-4351-8885-6432fd7e07ef",
        "title": "Power",
        "value": "Exceptional power and sound quality start with a good power supply. The MyConnect 250 will control any loudspeaker, thanks to its 2 toroidal transformers on either side of the product. You can choose any loudspeaker, from bookshelf to tall column.",
        "information": "Product Feature"
      },
