        "title": "Enhance your movies with stunning pictures and sound",
        "value": "This Ultra HD Blu-ray player faithfully reproduces the director's intended images. Unique processing technology maximizes the beauty of 4K content and network functions enable enjoyment of various types of 4K content.",
