      {
        "_type": "overviewField",
        "_key": "9c908628-512d-4f3b-93b9-36eb880cd9fa",
        "title": "Sturdy Support for Full-Room Sound",
        "value": "Easy to assemble, the AST-25 stands, made of robust steel, offer stability and adaptability. You can opt for adjustable floor spikes for carpets or floor protector discs for wood or tile floors. These versatile stands are designed to accommodate your needs on various surfaces. They provide unwavering support for your beloved speaker, allowing you to enjoy exceptional sound without worries of floor damage or instability.",
