      },
      {
        "_type": "overviewField",
        "_key": "3b31e99a-4f80-4966-a0d7-93ba0f99e181",
        "title": "A Stylish Finish to Your Room",
        "value": "The AST-25 showcases PSB's dedication to exceptional sound and style. Featuring an accent strip that complements the Alpha iQ speakers' diamond trim, it adds a touch of sophistication to your decor. Fully concealed wire management ensures that unsightly cables are hidden view for a tidy setup without the distraction of wires. Choose a black or white finish for a timeless look that matches your speakers and your room.",
